      "kind": "confluence",
      "ref": "https://dahl-it.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/DSPDOC/pages/22774149",
      "revision": "version:3",
      "confidence": "confirmed",
      "note": "Runbook/design: Features__IngressWithoutSnapshotCreation; admin recreate-all-snapshots for M3Cloud validproduct|directdeliverysupplier; SnapshotFullRebuildJobs in price-ingress DB; ASB empty/DLQ checks. Not deployment proof."
    },
